{"type":"message","id":"5f0f31a7","parentId":"fc870c81","timestamp":"2026-05-03T20:20:08.898Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both are running:\n- `ensoria-ui` is on port 5173 (Vite dev server)\n- `ensoria-api` is on port 3000 (hbci = 3000 in /etc/services, let me verify)\n\nActually, `hbci` is Home Banking Computer Interface, typically port 3000. So:\n- Frontend: http://localhost:5173\n- Backend API: http://localhost:3000\n\nLet me give AleX the frontend URL for the CRM.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Fatto! **Ensoria Manager (CRM)** è già in esecuzione in locale:\n\n👉 **http://localhost:5173**\n\nIl backend API gira sulla 3000, il frontend Vite sulla 5173 — entrambi up & running."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":792,"output":161,"cacheRead":28672,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":29625,"cost":{"input":0.00137808,"output":0.00056028,"cacheRead":0.00415744,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0060958}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777839602459,"responseId":"29e3ab37-f89b-4917-a93b-c82c3b65ffe0"}}
