{"type":"message","id":"e83b9f44","parentId":"576d328d","timestamp":"2026-05-03T20:43:36.216Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sun 2026-05-03 22:43 GMT+2] non sembra che il call to action per rimuovere un project non funzioni\nquando premo delete\n\napi.ts:31\n DELETE http://localhost:5173/api/projects/cmoq8gz5u000kxo1uoyfso8zx 500 (Internal Server Error)\nrequest @ api.ts:31\ndel @ api.ts:59\nmutationFn @ useProjects.ts:65\nawait in execute\nhandleDelete @ ProjectsPage.tsx:68\nonClick @ ProjectsPage.tsx:282\nVM196:1 Uncaught (in promise) SyntaxError: Failed to execute 'json' on 'Response': Unexpected end of JSON input\n at request (api.ts:32:26)\nrequest @ api.ts:32\nawait in request\ndel @ api.ts:59\nmutationFn @ useProjects.ts:65\nawait in execute\nhandleDelete @ ProjectsPage.tsx:68\nonClick @ ProjectsPage.tsx:282"}],"timestamp":1777841016119}}
